a/changelog#changed","content":"チート HUD が左からスライドするパネルではなく**画面全体**を覆うようになりました。各行が押しやすい大きさ（最小 104px）になり、`Screen.safeArea` を避けて配置され、広い画面では 2〜3 列に分かれます。下部には大きな `CLOSE` ボタンがあります。以前のパネルは `TerminalBehaviour.CheatHudFullScreen = false` と `CheatHudView.WidthPercent` で引き続き使えます。"},"38":{"id":"/ja/changelog-36","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added","content":"開閉リスナー: `TerminalBehaviour.VisibilityChanged`（コンソールと HUD をまとめて）、`ConsoleVisibilityChanged`、`CheatHudVisibilityChanged`。ビューからも `OnOpened` / `OnClosed` / `OnVisibilityChanged` で受け取れます。"},"39":{"id":"/ja/changelog-37","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added","content":"`TerminalBehaviour.PauseGameWhileOpen` / `PausedTimeScale`: 開いている間 `Time.timeScale` を固定し、閉じたときに元へ戻します。"},"40":{"id":"/ja/changelog-38","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added","content":"エディター・デスクトップ向けのコンソールキー: `F1`（切り替え）とバッククォート `` ` ``（開くだけなので入力の邪魔にならない）。チート HUD は `F10` に加えて `F2` でも開きます。"},"41":{"id":"/ja/changelog-39","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added","content":"プレイモード用の `Tools > Cheat Terminal` エディターメニュー（コンソール / HUD / ハンドルの切り替え、Pause Game While Open、手動ブートストラップ）。"},"42":{"id":"/ja/changelog-40","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added","content":"`TerminalShortcutKey` に `F1`〜`F4`、`F11`、`F12`、`BackQuote`、`Escape` を追加。`MultiFingerTapGesture` は 2 つ目のキー `AlternateKey` を受け取ります。"},"43":{"id":"/ja/changelog-41","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#fixed","content":"Input System のみのプロジェクトで `EventSystem` が作られず、コンソールとチート HUD のボタンがすべて反応しなかった問題。`InputSystemUIInputModule` 付きで作成するようになりました。"},"44":{"id":"/ja/changelog-42","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#documentation","content":"コミット履歴をもとに整理した開発の歩みページを追加 (ko / en / ja / zh)。"},"45":{"id":"/ja/changelog-43","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#changed-1","content":"右上の `>_` ハンドルは既定で非表示になりました。画面のどこでも **4 本指で 3 回タップ**すると表示され、同じジェスチャーで再び隠れます。コードからは `TerminalCornerTrigger.Visible` / `TerminalBehaviour.HandleVisible` で制御します（`TerminalCornerTrigger.Enabled` は別名として維持）。"},"46":{"id":"/ja/changelog-44","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-1","content":"チート HUD (`CheatHudView`): 左からスライドインする UI Toolkit パネル。登録済みのコマンドをカテゴリー別に表示します。**3 本指で 3 回タップ**（デスクトップは F10）または `TerminalBehaviour.Open/Close/ToggleCheatHud()` で切り替えます。引数のないチートはワンタップで実行され、`<...>` / `[...]` 引数を持つチートはインライン入力欄が開きます。検索欄、直近の実行を示すステータス行、コンソールを開く `>_` ボタンを含みます。"},"47":{"id":"/ja/changelog-45","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-1","content":"`MultiFingerTapGesture`: 「N 本指・M 連タップ」を検出する再利用可能なコンポーネント。指の本数が完全に一致した場合のみ成立するため、3 本指と 4 本指のジェスチャーが干渉しません。エディター・デスクトップ用のキーボードフォールバック（F9 / F10）付き。"},"48":{"id":"/ja/changelog-46","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-1","content":"`TerminalInput`: レガシー Input Manager と Input System パッケージの両方に対応する、リフレクション不要の入力抽象化。"},"49":{"id":"/ja/changelog-47","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-1","content":"チート作成時の規約をまとめた `AGENT.md`。"},"50":{"id":"/ja/changelog-48","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#changed-breaking","content":"reflection ベースの `[Terminal]` メソッド探索と呼び出しを削除しました。コマンドは `RegisterCommand(...)` で明示的に登録します。"},"51":{"id":"/ja/changelog-49","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#changed-breaking","content":"reflection ベースの Object Inspector module をデフォルト runtime から削除しました。"},"52":{"id":"/ja/changelog-50","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#changed-breaking","content":"EventSystem fallback は optional Input System 型を reflection で探索しなくなりました。Input System-only のプロジェクトでは `InputSystemUIInputModule` 付きの EventSystem を用意してください。"},"53":{"id":"/ja/changelog-51","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#fixed-1","content":"Terminal input は focus loss ではなく、明示的な submit のときだけ実行されます。"},"54":{"id":"/ja/changelog-52","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#fixed-1","content":"Terminal output は color tag で包む前に rich text-sensitive 文字を escape します。"},"55":{"id":"/ja/changelog-53","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#fixed-1","content":"Unity component commands は invariant-culture の数値 parsing、厳密な bool parsing、必要に応じた inactive-inclusive GameObject lookup を使います。"},"56":{"id":"/ja/changelog-54","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#fixed-1","content":"Logs / Performance module が作成する runtime helper GameObject は terminal bootstrap と一緒に dispose されます。"},"57":{"id":"/ja/changelog-55","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-2","content":"command name、usage keyword、command-specific provider の cached completion items を追加しました。"},"58":{"id":"/ja/changelog-56","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-2","content":"scene、logs、GameObject、component target、boolean value など、built-in command 向けの context-aware completion を追加しました。"},"59":{"id":"/ja/changelog-57","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-2","content":"reflection-free data lookup のための `data [table] [id|text]` command と `RegisterDataTable(...)` を追加しました。"},"60":{"id":"/ja/changelog-58","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-2","content":"Console、registered Commands、registered Data tables を表示する Terminal UI tabs を追加しました。"},"61":{"id":"/ja/changelog-59","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#変更","content":"名前空間を `UniTerminal` から `Achieve.CheatTerminal` に変更。"},"62":{"id":"/ja/changelog-60","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#追加-1","content":"Unity コンポーネントを操作する `transform`、`rb`、`cam`、`light`、`audio`、`time`、`go` コマンド。"},"63":{"id":"/ja/changelog-61","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#追加-1","content":"韓国語・英語・日本語・中国語のドキュメントと高度なモジュールの使用方法。"},"64":{"id":"/ja/changelog-62","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#changed-breaking-1","content":"内部協調用インターフェース (`ICommandRegistry`, `ICommandParser`, `ICommandHistory`, `IAutoCompleteProvider`, `IAliasResolver`, `IArgumentConverter`, `ITerminalTrigger`, `ITerminal`) と `TerminalBuilder` を削除しました。core `Terminal` は concrete collaborator を所有する concrete class になりました。拡張ポイントとして残るのは `ICommand`, `ICommandOutput`, `ITerminalView`, `ITerminalModule` です。"},"65":{"id":"/ja/changelog-63","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#changed-breaking-1","content":"command 用 marker interface はなくなり、`[Terminal]` attribute が唯一の marker になりました。"},"66":{"id":"/ja/changelog-64","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#changed-breaking-1","content":"`Terminal.ScanStaticCommands()` は user assemblies を scan し、すべての static `[Terminal]` methods を自動登録します。bootstrap 時に `TerminalBehaviour.AutoScanStaticCommands` を通じて実行されます。instance commands は引き続き `Register(this)` を使います。"},"67":{"id":"/ja/changelog-65","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-3","content":"Runtime Logs module: `Debug.Log` output を ring buffer に収集し、`logs [n | error | warning | info | <text> | find <text> | clear | export]` で扱えます。export は `Application.persistentDataPath` に書き込むため、device から logs を回収できます。"},"68":{"id":"/ja/changelog-66","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-3","content":"input field で Up/Down arrow により前後の command history を呼び出せます。uGUI `IMoveHandler` 経由なので、legacy Input Manager と Input System package の両方で動作します。"},"69":{"id":"/ja/changelog-67","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-3","content":"`help <category>` は category 内の commands を descriptions 付きで表示します。`help` は `help <command>` / `help <category>` を案内します。"},"70":{"id":"/ja/changelog-68","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#fixed-2","content":"Input System package が有効な場合、EventSystem は reflection 経由で `InputSystemUIInputModule` を作成するようになり、毎 frame の `InvalidOperationException` を避けます。"},"71":{"id":"/ja/changelog-69","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#fixed-2","content":"top-right corner trigger は表示される `>_` handle になり、single tap で開くようになりました。"},"72":{"id":"/ja/changelog-70","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-4","content":"Core command system: `ICommandRegistry`, quote-aware `ICommandParser`, `ICommandHistory`, `IAutoCompleteProvider`, `IAliasResolver`, `IArgumentConverter`, default implementation 付きの `ICommandOutput`。"},"73":{"id":"/ja/changelog-71","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-4","content":"`[Terminal(\"name {0}\")]` attribute と reflection-based `AttributeCommand` binding。positional binding、optional parameters、`CommandContext` injection を含みます。"},"74":{"id":"/ja/changelog-72","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-4","content":"`TerminalBuilder` で組み立てる interface-driven `Terminal` core。"},"75":{"id":"/ja/changelog-73","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-4","content":"closed 時に zero idle cost になる uGUI overlay view (`UGuiTerminalView`)。"},"76":{"id":"/ja/changelog-74","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-4","content":"top-right corner open gesture (`TerminalCornerTrigger`, default は double-tap)。"},"77":{"id":"/ja/changelog-75","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-4","content":"static convenience API を持つ `TerminalBehaviour` bootstrap。editor と development build では auto-bootstrap します。"},"78":{"id":"/ja/changelog-76","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-4","content":"built-in commands: `help`, `clear`, `history`, `echo`, `alias`。"},"79":{"id":"/ja/changelog-77","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-4","content":"bootstrap 上の `InstallModule` / `GetModule<T>` による module system (`ITerminalModule`)。"},"80":{"id":"/ja/changelog-78","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-4","content":"Scene Tools module: `scene list | load <name> [additive] | unload <name>`。"},"81":{"id":"/ja/changelog-79","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-4","content":"Object Inspector module: `find`, `inspect`, `set <name>.<member> <value>`, `call`。explicit object registration (`ObjectInspectorModule.RegisterObject`) に対応。"},"82":{"id":"/ja/changelog-80","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-4","content":"Performance Monitor module: `perf` (FPS, frame ms, memory, GC, render stats via `ProfilerRecorder`)。"},"83":{"id":"/ja/changelog-81","page_id":"/ja/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/changelog#added-4","content":"Basic Usage sample。"},"84":{"id":"/ja/getting-started","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","type":"page","content":"はじめに","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":[],"url":"/ja/getting-started"},"85":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-0","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/getting-started#インストール","content":"インストール"},"86":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-1","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/getting-started#コンソールを開く","content":"コンソールを開く"},"87":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-2","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/getting-started#エディターで使う","content":"エディターで使う"},"88":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-3","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/getting-started#コードから制御","content":"コードから制御"},"89":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-4","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/getting-started#パラメーターの入力と実行","content":"パラメーターの入力と実行"},"90":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-5","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/getting-started#インストール","content":"Unity Package Manager で **Add package from git URL** を選びます。"},"91":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-6","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/getting-started#コンソールを開く","content":"エディターと開発ビルドでは、シーン読み込み後に自動でブートストラップされます。右上のドックでスライダーのアイコンは Cheat Library、ターミナルのアイコンは Terminal を開きます。グリップやアイコンをドラッグすると、安全領域内でドックを移動できます。"},"92":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-7","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/getting-started#コンソールを開く","content":"操作"},"93":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-8","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/getting-started#コンソールを開く","content":"方法"},"94":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-9","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/getting-started#コンソールを開く","content":"エディター / デスクトップ"},"95":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-10","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/getting-started#コンソールを開く","content":"右上の `Terminal` ハンドルの表示 / 非表示"},"96":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-11","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/getting-started#コンソールを開く","content":"**4 本指の同時タップ 3 回**"},"97":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-12","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/getting-started#コンソールを開く","content":"`F9`"},"98":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-13","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/getting-started#コンソールを開く","content":"チート HUD の開閉"},"99":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-14","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/getting-started#コンソールを開く","content":"**3 本指の同時タップ 3 回**"},"100":{"id":"/ja/getting-started-15","page_id":"/ja/getting-started","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/getting-started#コンソールを開く","content":"`F1`, `F10`"},"101":{"id":"/j