138":{"id":"/ja/history-20","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#一覧","content":"マルチタッチジェスチャーで UI を呼び出し、UI Toolkit のチート HUD を追加"},"139":{"id":"/ja/history-21","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#一覧","content":"1.0.2"},"140":{"id":"/ja/history-22","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#一覧","content":"2026-06-27"},"141":{"id":"/ja/history-23","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#一覧","content":"リフレクションを完全に排除、文脈対応の補完、データテーブル"},"142":{"id":"/ja/history-24","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#一覧","content":"1.0.1"},"143":{"id":"/ja/history-25","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#一覧","content":"2026-05-30"},"144":{"id":"/ja/history-26","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#一覧","content":"名前空間 `Achieve.CheatTerminal`、Unity コンポーネントコマンド"},"145":{"id":"/ja/history-27","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#一覧","content":"1.0.0"},"146":{"id":"/ja/history-28","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#一覧","content":"2026-05-29"},"147":{"id":"/ja/history-29","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#一覧","content":"具象コア中心に書き直し、Logs モジュール"},"148":{"id":"/ja/history-30","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#一覧","content":"0.1.0"},"149":{"id":"/ja/history-31","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#一覧","content":"2026-05-29"},"150":{"id":"/ja/history-32","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#一覧","content":"最初のコア / uGUI ビュー / モジュールシステム"},"151":{"id":"/ja/history-33","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#3-つの転換点","content":"**リフレクション → 明示的な登録。** 0.1.0 は `[Terminal(\"name {0}\")]` 属性とリフレクション\nバインディングでコマンドを探し、1.0.0 では static メソッドの自動スキャンも加わりました。\nIL2CPP/AOT ビルドでも挙動が予測できるように、1.0.2 で属性・自動スキャン・リフレクション\n呼び出し経路をすべて削除し、`RegisterCommand(...)` による明示登録だけを残しました。"},"152":{"id":"/ja/history-34","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#3-つの転換点","content":"**インターフェイスの分解 → 具象コア。** 0.1.0 の協力オブジェクト用インターフェイス\n（`ICommandRegistry`、`ICommandParser`、`IAutoCompleteProvider` など）と `TerminalBuilder`\nは 1.0.0 で削除され、`Terminal` が具象の協力オブジェクトを直接保持する形になりました。\n拡張点は `ICommand`、`ICommandOutput`、`ITerminalView`、`ITerminalModule` の 4 つだけです。"},"153":{"id":"/ja/history-35","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#3-つの転換点","content":"**常時表示の UI → ジェスチャーで呼び出す UI。** 0.1.0 の見えないダブルタップ領域は 1.0.0 で\n目に見える `>_` ハンドル（シングルタップ）になり、1.0.3 ではそのハンドル自体が既定で非表示に\nなり、マルチタッチジェスチャーからのみ呼び出せるようになりました。"},"154":{"id":"/ja/history-36","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#103--ジェスチャーとチート-hud","content":"右上の `>_` ハンドルは既定で非表示になり、**4 本指の 3 連タップ**で表示・非表示を切り替えます。"},"155":{"id":"/ja/history-37","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#103--ジェスチャーとチート-hud","content":"左からスライドインする **UI Toolkit のチート HUD** を追加しました。登録済みのコマンドが\nカテゴリー別に自動で並び、引数のないチートはワンタップで実行できます。\n**3 本指の 3 連タップ**で開閉します。 → チート HUD"},"156":{"id":"/ja/history-38","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#103--ジェスチャーとチート-hud","content":"ジェスチャーは `MultiFingerTapGesture` が担当し、指の本数が完全に一致した場合のみ成立するため、\n3 本指と 4 本指のジェスチャーが互いに誤作動しません。"},"157":{"id":"/ja/history-39","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#103--ジェスチャーとチート-hud","content":"タッチ入力は `TerminalInput` の抽象化を通し、レガシー Input Manager と Input System パッケージの\n両方にリフレクションなしで対応します（後者はバージョンデファインで解決される任意依存）。"},"158":{"id":"/ja/history-40","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#103--ジェスチャーとチート-hud","content":"チート作成時の規約をまとめた `AGENT.md` をリポジトリ直下に追加しました。"},"159":{"id":"/ja/history-41","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#102--リフレクション排除と補完の強化","content":"`TerminalAttribute`、`AttributeCommand`、リフレクションベースの Object Inspector モジュールを\n削除しました。属性で登録していたコマンドは `RegisterCommand(...)` へ移す必要があります。"},"160":{"id":"/ja/history-42","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#102--リフレクション排除と補完の強化","content":"補完がコマンド名・`usage` のキーワード・コマンド固有の候補をキャッシュし、シーン、ログ、\nGameObject、コンポーネント対象、真偽値などの文脈候補を提供します\n（`ICommandCompletionProvider`、`CommandCompletionContext`、`CompletionItem` を導入）。"},"161":{"id":"/ja/history-43","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#102--リフレクション排除と補完の強化","content":"`RegisterDataTable(...)` と `data [table] [id|text]` コマンドで、ゲームのデータテーブルを\nリフレクションなしで参照できます。"},"162":{"id":"/ja/history-44","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#102--リフレクション排除と補完の強化","content":"ターミナル UI に `Console / Commands / Data` タブが加わりました。"},"163":{"id":"/ja/history-45","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#102--リフレクション排除と補完の強化","content":"修正: フォーカス喪失ではなく明示的な submit でのみ実行、出力のリッチテキストエスケープ、\nUnity コンポーネントコマンドの invariant カルチャー解析、Logs・Performance モジュールが\n生成したヘルパー GameObject の破棄。"},"164":{"id":"/ja/history-46","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#102--リフレクション排除と補完の強化","content":"同時期にドキュメントサイトを Docusaurus から **Fumadocs + Next.js** へ移行し、フォルダー名を\n`docs~` に統一、Introduction / Getting started / Usage / Changelog の構成を整え、\n韓国語版 `CHANGELOG.ko.md` を追加しました。"},"165":{"id":"/ja/history-47","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#101--名前空間と-unity-コンポーネントコマンド","content":"名前空間を `UniTerminal` → `Achieve.CheatTerminal` に変更しました（互換性なし）。"},"166":{"id":"/ja/history-48","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#101--名前空間と-unity-コンポーネントコマンド","content":"Unity 組み込みコンポーネントを直接操作するコマンド（`transform`、`rb`、`cam`、`light`、\n`audio`、`time`、`go`）を追加しました。 → Unity コンポーネントコマンド"},"167":{"id":"/ja/history-49","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#101--名前空間と-unity-コンポーネントコマンド","content":"ドキュメントを ko / en / ja / zh の 4 言語に対応させ、`ITerminalModule` の応用セクションと\n`CHANGELOG` を導入しました。"},"168":{"id":"/ja/history-50","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#100--具象コアへの書き直し","content":"協力オブジェクト用インターフェイスと `TerminalBuilder` を削除し、`Terminal` を具象クラスにしました。"},"169":{"id":"/ja/history-51","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#100--具象コアへの書き直し","content":"`Terminal.ScanStaticCommands()` が static な `[Terminal]` メソッドを自動登録しました\n（この機能は 1.0.2 で削除）。"},"170":{"id":"/ja/history-52","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#100--具象コアへの書き直し","content":"**Runtime Logs モジュール**: `Debug.Log` をリングバッファに集め、\n`logs [n | error | warning | info | <text> | find <text> | clear | export]` で参照します。\n`export` は `Application.persistentDataPath` に書き出すため、実機からも回収できます。"},"171":{"id":"/ja/history-53","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#100--具象コアへの書き直し","content":"入力欄で上下矢印による履歴呼び出し、`help <category>` に対応しました。"},"172":{"id":"/ja/history-54","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#100--具象コアへの書き直し","content":"EventSystem の入力モジュールを修正し、右上トリガーを目に見える `>_` ハンドル + シングルタップに\n変更、Unity の `.meta` を整備し、パッケージ名を `com.achieve.cheat-terminal` に確定しました。"},"173":{"id":"/ja/history-55","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#100--具象コアへの書き直し","content":"ドキュメントサイト（Docusaurus）と GitHub Pages への自動デプロイ CI を追加しました。"},"174":{"id":"/ja/history-56","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#010--最初のリリース","content":"引用符を解釈するパーサー、履歴、エイリアス、引数変換、補完、出力バッファーからなるコア。"},"175":{"id":"/ja/history-57","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#010--最初のリリース","content":"`[Terminal]` 属性のリフレクションバインディングと `TerminalBuilder` による組み立て。"},"176":{"id":"/ja/history-58","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#010--最初のリリース","content":"閉じている間は完全に無効化される uGUI オーバーレイビューと、右上のダブルタップトリガー。"},"177":{"id":"/ja/history-59","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#010--最初のリリース","content":"組み込みコマンド `help` / `clear` / `history` / `echo` / `alias`。"},"178":{"id":"/ja/history-60","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#010--最初のリリース","content":"モジュールシステム（`ITerminalModule`）と Scene Tools / Object Inspector / Performance\nモジュール、Basic Usage サンプル。"},"179":{"id":"/ja/history-61","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#アップグレード早見表","content":"これまで"},"180":{"id":"/ja/history-62","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#アップグレード早見表","content":"現在"},"181":{"id":"/ja/history-63","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#アップグレード早見表","content":"`[Terminal]` 属性 / static 自動スキャン"},"182":{"id":"/ja/history-64","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#アップグレード早見表","content":"`TerminalBehaviour.RegisterCommand(...)`"},"183":{"id":"/ja/history-65","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#アップグレード早見表","content":"`UniTerminal` 名前空間"},"184":{"id":"/ja/history-66","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#アップグレード早見表","content":"`Achieve.CheatTerminal`"},"185":{"id":"/ja/history-67","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#アップグレード早見表","content":"`TerminalBuilder` による組み立て"},"186":{"id":"/ja/history-68","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#アップグレード早見表","content":"`new Terminal()` + `AttachView(...)`"},"187":{"id":"/ja/history-69","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#アップグレード早見表","content":"Object Inspector モジュール"},"188":{"id":"/ja/history-70","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#アップグレード早見表","content":"`RegisterDataTable(...)` と `data` コマンド"},"189":{"id":"/ja/history-71","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#アップグレード早見表","content":"常に表示される右上ハンドル"},"190":{"id":"/ja/history-72","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#アップグレード早見表","content":"4 本指の 3 連タップ（`TerminalBehaviour.HandleVisible`）"},"191":{"id":"/ja/history-73","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#アップグレード早見表","content":"`TerminalCornerTrigger.Enabled`"},"192":{"id":"/ja/history-74","page_id":"/ja/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/history#アップグレード早見表","content":"`TerminalCornerTrigger.Visible`（`Enabled` は別名として維持）"},"193":{"id":"/ja","page_id":"/ja","type":"page","content":"소개","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":[],"url":"/ja"},"194":{"id":"/ja-0","page_id":"/ja","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja#特徴","content":"特徴"},"195":{"id":"/ja-1","page_id":"/ja","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja#要件","content":"要件"},"196":{"id":"/ja-2","page_id":"/ja","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja","content":"Unity ランタイム開発者コンソールです。チート、デバッグ、ログ確認、実行時の状態操作を 1 か所で扱えます。"},"197":{"id":"/ja-3","page_id":"/ja","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja","content":"コマンドは `RegisterCommand(...)` で明示的に登録します。デフォルトのランタイム経路では自動アセンブリ走査や reflection 呼び出しを使わないため、IL2CPP/AOT ビルドでも挙動を予測しやすくなります。閉じている間は **待機コスト 0** の uGUI オーバーレイとして動作します。"},"198":{"id":"/ja-4","page_id":"/ja","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja#特徴","content":"**明示登録** - `RegisterCommand(\"name\", ctx => ...)` で登録。隠れた reflection scan はありません。"},"199":{"id":"/ja-5","page_id":"/ja","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja#特徴","content":"**Runtime IntelliSense** - command / keyword / data table / row suggestions を詳細付きで表示します。"},"200":{"id":"/ja-6","page_id":"/ja","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja#特徴","content":"**性能優先** - 閉じている間は Canvas を無効化し、出力は capped ring buffer、履歴移動は共通の `TerminalInput` 経由。"},"201":{"id":"/ja-7","page_id":"/ja","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja#特徴","content":"**モジュール式** - Scene / Data / Performance / Logs / Unity Components を標準搭載。"},"202":{"id":"/ja-8","page_id":"/ja","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja#特徴","content":"**Tab UI** - Console / Commands / Data tab で出力、登録コマンド、登録データを確認できます。"},"203":{"id":"/ja-9","page_id":"/ja","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja#特徴","content":"**モバイル対応** - マルチタッチジェスチャー（3 本指 / 4 本指の 3 連タップ）で呼び出し、端末上のログをファイルに export できます。"},"204":{"id":"/ja-10","page_id":"/ja","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja#特徴","content":"**チート HUD** - 登録済みのチートを、全画面の UI Toolkit パネルでパラメーターを入力し Run で実行。開閉リスナーで `Time.timeScale` を制御できます。"},"205":{"id":"/ja-11","page_id":"/ja","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja#要件","content":"Unity 6 (6000.x)"},"206":{"id":"/ja-12","page_id":"/ja","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja#要件","content":"`com.unity.ugui` (標準同梱)"},"207":{"id":"/ja-13","page_id":"/ja","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja#要件","content":"次: はじめに"},"208":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","type":"page","content":"コマンドを追加する","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使い方"],"tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands"},"209":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-0","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands#基本登録","content":"基本登録"},"210":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-1","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands#static-コマンド","content":"static コマンド"},"211":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-2","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands#引数","content":"引数"},"212":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-3","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands#補完候補を追加する","content":"補完候補を追加する"},"213":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-4","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands#data-table-登録","content":"Data table 登録"},"214":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-5","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands#出力","content":"出力"},"215":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-6","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands#高度-iterminalmodule","content":"高度: ITerminalModule"},"216":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-7","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","content":"コマンドは `RegisterCommand(...)` で明示的に登録します。自動 scan はなく、実行経路も reflection 呼び出しではなく `CommandContext` delegate です。"},"217":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-8","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","content":"> **usage 文字列のルール** — `usage` はチート HUD での実行方法を決めます。\n> 引数が不要なら括弧なし（`god`）、必須引数は `<amount>`、任意引数は `[amount]` と書きます。\n> HUD はパラメーター別の入力欄と Run ボタンを生成します。コマンド名の入力は不要です。 → チート HUD"},"218":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-9","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands#基本登録","content":"コンソールで `gold 100000` や `god` を実行できます。`help Cheats` はカテゴリ内のコマンドを説明付きで表示します。"},"219":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-10","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands#static-コマンド","content":"static メソッドも自動収集しません。必要なタイミングで明示的に登録してください。"},"220":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-11","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands#static-コマンド","content":"登録:"},"221":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-12","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands#引数","content":"`CommandContext` から引数を読みます。"},"222":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-13","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands#引数","content":"`ctx.Args`: 元の引数リスト"},"223":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-14","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands#引数","content":"`ctx.Has(index)`: 引数が存在するか"},"224":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-15","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/adding-commands#引数","content":"`ctx.GetString/GetInt/GetFloat/GetBool`: fallback 付きの簡易 getter"},"225":{"id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands-16","page_id":"/ja/usage/adding-commands","tags":[]