s":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud#レイアウト","content":"画面が広い場合（横向き、タブレット、エディターの Game ビュー）は一覧が自動で 2〜3 列になります。"},"260":{"id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud-24","page_id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud#レイアウト","content":"下部のステータス行に大きな `CLOSE` ボタンがあります。縦長の画面で上部の `X` に指が届かないときに使えます。"},"261":{"id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud-25","page_id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud#レイアウト","content":"以前のように左からスライドする細いパネルが必要なら、全画面表示をオフにします。"},"262":{"id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud-26","page_id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud#開閉リスナー","content":"HUD やコンソールを開いてもゲームは動き続けます。開閉を購読して `Time.timeScale` を下げたり、\n入力を止めたりしてください。"},"263":{"id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud-27","page_id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud#開閉リスナー","content":"時間を止めるだけなら 1 行で済みます。開いたときの `Time.timeScale` を保存し、閉じたときに戻します。"},"264":{"id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud-28","page_id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud#開閉リスナー","content":"購読の解除は `-=` です。ビューから直接受け取ることもできます:\n`CheatHudView.OnOpened` / `OnClosed` / `OnVisibilityChanged`、および `UGuiTerminalView` の同名イベント。"},"265":{"id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud-29","page_id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud#表示ルール","content":"コマンドは `category` ごとにまとめられ、組み込みの `System` カテゴリーは常に最後に並びます。"},"266":{"id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud-30","page_id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud#表示ルール","content":"上部の検索欄で名前 / 説明 / カテゴリーを絞り込めます。"},"267":{"id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud-31","page_id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud#表示ルール","content":"`usage` 文字列が実行方法を決めます。"},"268":{"id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud-32","page_id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud#表示ルール","content":"usage"},"269":{"id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud-33","page_id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud#表示ルール","conte