ックを移動できます。"},"281":{"id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud-45","page_id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud#ドックとショートカット","content":"`F1` は Cheat Library、`F2` は Terminal の開閉です。`F10` でもチート UI を開き、`F9` でドックの表示を切り替えます。バッククォートは Terminal を開くだけで、Escape は現在の画面を閉じます。"},"282":{"id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud-46","page_id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud#パラメーターの入力と実行","content":"パラメーター欄は常に表示されます。コマンド名ではなく値だけを入力し、Run または Enter で実行します。`<amount>` は必須、`[amount]` は任意、`<x> <y> <z>` は座標別の入力欄です。`<on|off>` は選択ボタンも表示します。必須欄はすべて入力し、任意欄は末尾から省略してください。`[args]` と `<text...>` は空白区切りの複数引数を受け取り、空白を含む一つの値は引用符で囲みます。"},"283":{"id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud-47","page_id":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/ja/usage/cheat-hud#パラメーターの入力と実行","content":"カテゴリーボタンと検索でコマンドを探せます。入力値は絞り込み、画面サイズの変更、再表示後も保持されます。結果やエラーはカード、下部のステータス行、Terminal に表示されます。別の画面を開くと前の画面は閉じます。"},"284":{"id":"/ja/usage/commands","page_id":"/ja/usage/commands","type":"page","content":"コマンドリファレンス","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使い方"],"tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/commands"},"285":{"id":"/ja/usage/commands-0","page_id":"/ja/usage/commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/commands#組み込みコマンド","content":"組み込みコマンド"},"286":{"id":"/ja/usage/commands-1","page_id":"/ja/usage/commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/commands#モジュール","content":"モジュール"},"287":{"id":"/ja/usage/commands-2","page_id":"/ja/usage/commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/commands#scene","content":"Scene"},"288":{"id":"/ja/usage/commands-3","page_id":"/ja/usage/commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/commands#data","content":"Data"},"289":{"id":"/ja/usage/commands-4","page_id":"/ja/usage/commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/commands#performance","content":"Performance"},"290":{"id":"/ja/usage/commands-5","page_id":"/ja/usage/commands","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/ja/usage/commands#logs","content":"Logs"},"291":{"id":"/ja/usage/commands-6","p