:"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/changelog#added-4","content":"Added"},"26":{"id":"/zh/changelog-24","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog","content":"这里记录包的主要变更。本项目遵循 Semantic Versioning。"},"27":{"id":"/zh/changelog-25","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog","content":"每个版本的背景与设计变化整理在开发历程中。"},"28":{"id":"/zh/changelog-26","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#新增","content":"默认显示的开发者工具栏，可在安全区域内拖动，分别打开作弊库与 Terminal。"},"29":{"id":"/zh/changelog-27","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#新增","content":"根据 usage 生成必填、可选、选项、坐标和多个参数输入框，并验证及保留输入值。"},"30":{"id":"/zh/changelog-28","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#新增","content":"分类筛选、卡片执行结果及错误。Terminal 新增 Run、Tab 补全、历史记录操作及安全区域布局。"},"31":{"id":"/zh/changelog-29","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#新增","content":"本地作弊命令编写技能，以及 Unity 核心与 UI 测试。"},"32":{"id":"/zh/changelog-30","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#变更与修复","content":"`F1`: Cheat Library，`F2`: Terminal，`F10`: 作弊 UI，`F9`: 工具栏，Escape: 关闭。"},"33":{"id":"/zh/changelog-31","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#变更与修复","content":"使用 Run 按钮执行命令，切换界面时关闭之前的界面，并保留暂停状态。"},"34":{"id":"/zh/changelog-32","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#变更与修复","content":"保留参数中的空格、引号、反斜杠和空字符串，并显示执行错误。"},"35":{"id":"/zh/changelog-33","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#变更与修复","content":"为工具栏图标和面板背景创建所需的 CanvasRenderer。没有主题资源时也保留输入框的最小高度，避免与 Run 按钮重叠。"},"36":{"id":"/zh/changelog-34","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#变更与修复","content":"将之前的版本记录整理为 `1.0.0` 至 `1.0.4`，本次 UI 更新设为 `1.1.0`。"},"37":{"id":"/zh/changelog-35","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#changed","content":"作弊 HUD 由从左侧滑出的面板改为**覆盖整个屏幕**。行的尺寸满足点按需求（最小 104px），内容按 `Screen.safeArea` 内缩，宽屏会自动分成 2\\~3 列，底部还有一个大号 `CLOSE` 按钮。仍需旧面板时可用 `TerminalBehaviour.CheatHudFullScreen = false` 与 `CheatHudView.WidthPercent`。"},"38":{"id":"/zh/changelog-36","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added","content":"打开 / 关闭监听: `TerminalBehaviour.VisibilityChanged`（控制台与 HUD 合并）、`ConsoleVisibilityChanged`、`CheatHudVisibilityChanged`。视图也会直接触发 `OnOpened` / `OnClosed` / `OnVisibilityChanged`。"},"39":{"id":"/zh/changelog-37","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added","content":"`TerminalBehaviour.PauseGameWhileOpen` / `PausedTimeScale`: 打开期间固定 `Time.timeScale`，关闭时恢复原值。"},"40":{"id":"/zh/changelog-38","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added","content":"面向编辑器和桌面的控制台快捷键: `F1` 开关，反引号 `` ` `` 只负责打开（输入命令时不会误触）。作弊 HUD 除 `F10` 外也支持 `F2`。"},"41":{"id":"/zh/changelog-39","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added","content":"播放模式下的 `Tools > Cheat Terminal` 编辑器菜单（开关控制台 / HUD / 手柄，Pause Game While Open，手动 Bootstrap）。"},"42":{"id":"/zh/changelog-40","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added","content":"`TerminalShortcutKey` 新增 `F1`\\~`F4`、`F11`、`F12`、`BackQuote`、`Escape`; `MultiFingerTapGesture` 支持第二个按键 `AlternateKey`。"},"43":{"id":"/zh/changelog-41","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#fixed","content":"仅使用 Input System 的项目不会创建 `EventSystem`，导致控制台和作弊 HUD 的按钮全部失效。现在会附带 `InputSystemUIInputModule` 创建。"},"44":{"id":"/zh/changelog-42","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#documentation","content":"新增根据提交记录整理的开发历程页面 (ko / en / ja / zh)。"},"45":{"id":"/zh/changelog-43","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#changed-1","content":"右上角的 `>_` 手柄默认隐藏。在屏幕任意位置**四指连点 3 次**即可显示，再做一次同样的手势则隐藏。代码中可通过 `TerminalCornerTrigger.Visible` / `TerminalBehaviour.HandleVisible` 控制（`TerminalCornerTrigger.Enabled` 保留为别名）。"},"46":{"id":"/zh/changelog-44","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-1","content":"作弊 HUD (`CheatHudView`): 从左侧滑入的 UI Toolkit 面板，按分类列出所有已注册命令。通过**三指连点 3 次**（桌面为 F10）或 `TerminalBehaviour.Open/Close/ToggleCheatHud()` 切换。无参数的命令点按一次即可执行，带 `<...>` / `[...]` 参数的命令会展开内联输入框。面板包含搜索框、最近执行状态栏，以及打开控制台的 `>_` 按钮。"},"47":{"id":"/zh/changelog-45","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-1","content":"`MultiFingerTapGesture`: 可复用的“N 指 M 连点”检测组件。仅在手指数量完全一致时成立，因此三指与四指手势不会互相触发。提供编辑器 / 桌面的键盘回退（F9 / F10）。"},"48":{"id":"/zh/changelog-46","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-1","content":"`TerminalInput`: 同时支持旧版 Input Manager 与 Input System 包的免反射输入抽象。"},"49":{"id":"/zh/changelog-47","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-1","content":"新增说明作弊命令编写规范的 `AGENT.md`。"},"50":{"id":"/zh/changelog-48","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#changed-breaking","content":"移除了基于 reflection 的 `[Terminal]` 方法发现和调用。命令现在通过 `RegisterCommand(...)` 显式注册。"},"51":{"id":"/zh/changelog-49","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#changed-breaking","content":"从默认 runtime 中移除了基于 reflection 的 Object Inspector module。"},"52":{"id":"/zh/changelog-50","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#changed-breaking","content":"EventSystem fallback 不再通过 reflection 探测 optional Input System 类型。Input System-only 项目应自行提供带 `InputSystemUIInputModule` 的 EventSystem。"},"53":{"id":"/zh/changelog-51","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#fixed-1","content":"Terminal input 现在只会在显式 submit 时执行，不会在 focus loss 时执行。"},"54":{"id":"/zh/changelog-52","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#fixed-1","content":"Terminal output 在包裹 color tag 前会 escape rich text-sensitive 字符。"},"55":{"id":"/zh/changelog-53","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#fixed-1","content":"Unity component commands 现在使用 invariant-culture 数字解析、严格 bool 解析，并在适当场景下包含 inactive GameObject lookup。"},"56":{"id":"/zh/changelog-54","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#fixed-1","content":"Logs / Performance module 创建的 runtime helper GameObject 会随 terminal bootstrap 一起 dispose。"},"57":{"id":"/zh/changelog-55","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-2","content":"添加了 command name、usage keyword 和 command-specific provider 的 cached completion items。"},"58":{"id":"/zh/changelog-56","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-2","content":"添加了 built-in command 的 context-aware completions，包括 scenes、logs、GameObjects、component targets 和 boolean values。"},"59":{"id":"/zh/changelog-57","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-2","content":"添加了用于 reflection-free data lookup 的 `data [table] [id|text]` command 和 `RegisterDataTable(...)`。"},"60":{"id":"/zh/changelog-58","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-2","content":"添加了可查看 Console、registered Commands 和 registered Data tables 的 Terminal UI tabs。"},"61":{"id":"/zh/changelog-59","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#变更","content":"将命名空间从 `UniTerminal` 改为 `Achieve.CheatTerminal`。"},"62":{"id":"/zh/changelog-60","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#新增-1","content":"操作 Unity 组件的命令：`transform`、`rb`、`cam`、`light`、`audio`、`time`、`go`。"},"63":{"id":"/zh/changelog-61","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#新增-1","content":"韩语、英语、日语、中文文档，以及高级模块用法。"},"64":{"id":"/zh/changelog-62","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#changed-breaking-1","content":"移除了内部协作接口 (`ICommandRegistry`, `ICommandParser`, `ICommandHistory`, `IAutoCompleteProvider`, `IAliasResolver`, `IArgumentConverter`, `ITerminalTrigger`, `ITerminal`) 和 `TerminalBuilder`。core `Terminal` 现在是拥有 concrete collaborators 的 concrete class。真正保留的扩展点只有 `ICommand`, `ICommandOutput`, `ITerminalView`, `ITerminalModule`。"},"65":{"id":"/zh/changelog-63","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#changed-breaking-1","content":"不再使用 command marker interface，`[Terminal]` attribute 是唯一 marker。"},"66":{"id":"/zh/changelog-64","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#changed-breaking-1","content":"`Terminal.ScanStaticCommands()` 会扫描 user assemblies 并自动注册所有 static `[Terminal]` methods。bootstrap 会在启动时通过 `TerminalBehaviour.AutoScanStaticCommands` 执行它。instance commands 仍然使用 `Register(this)`。"},"67":{"id":"/zh/changelog-65","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-3","content":"Runtime Logs module: 将 `Debug.Log` output 收集到 ring buffer，并通过 `logs [n | error | warning | info | <text> | find <text> | clear | export]` 操作。export 会写入 `Application.persistentDataPath`，方便从 device 取回 logs。"},"68":{"id":"/zh/changelog-66","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-3","content":"input field 支持用 Up/Down arrow 召回上一条/下一条 command history。它通过 uGUI `IMoveHandler` 实现，因此兼容 legacy Input Manager 和 Input System package。"},"69":{"id":"/zh/changelog-67","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-3","content":"`help <category>` 会列出某个 category 中的 commands 及 descriptions。`help` 现在会提示 `help <command>` / `help <category>`。"},"70":{"id":"/zh/changelog-68","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#fixed-2","content":"当 Input System package 启用时，EventSystem 会通过 reflection 创建 `InputSystemUIInputModule`，避免每 frame 出现 `InvalidOperationException`。"},"71":{"id":"/zh/changelog-69","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#fixed-2","content":"top-right corner trigger 现在是可见的 `>_` handle，并且 single tap 即可打开。"},"72":{"id":"/zh/changelog-70","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-4","content":"Core command system: `ICommandRegistry`, quote-aware `ICommandParser`, `ICommandHistory`, `IAutoCompleteProvider`, `IAliasResolver`, `IArgumentConverter`, 以及带 default implementation 的 `ICommandOutput`。"},"73":{"id":"/zh/changelog-71","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-4","content":"`[Terminal(\"name {0}\")]` attribute 和 reflection-based `AttributeCommand` binding，包括 positional binding、optional parameters 和 `CommandContext` injection。"},"74":{"id":"/zh/changelog-72","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-4","content":"通过 `TerminalBuilder` 组装的 interface-driven `Terminal` core。"},"75":{"id":"/zh/changelog-73","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-4","content":"uGUI overlay view (`UGuiTerminalView`) 在 closed 时停用，实现 zero idle cost。"},"76":{"id":"/zh/changelog-74","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-4","content":"top-right corner open gesture (`TerminalCornerTrigger`，default 是 double-tap)。"},"77":{"id":"/zh/changelog-75","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-4","content":"带 static convenience API 的 `TerminalBehaviour` bootstrap，在 editor 和 development build 中 auto-bootstrap。"},"78":{"id":"/zh/changelog-76","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-4","content":"built-in commands: `help`, `clear`, `history`, `echo`, `alias`。"},"79":{"id":"/zh/changelog-77","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-4","content":"module system (`ITerminalModule`)，在 bootstrap 上提供 `InstallModule` / `GetModule<T>`。"},"80":{"id":"/zh/changelog-78","page_id":"/zh/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/changelog#added-4","content":"Scene Tools module: `scene list | load <name> [additive] | unload <name>`。"},"81":{"