tent":"1.0.0"},"146":{"id":"/zh/history-28","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#概览","content":"2026-05-29"},"147":{"id":"/zh/history-29","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#概览","content":"围绕具体核心重写，新增 Logs 模块"},"148":{"id":"/zh/history-30","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#概览","content":"0.1.0"},"149":{"id":"/zh/history-31","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#概览","content":"2026-05-29"},"150":{"id":"/zh/history-32","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#概览","content":"最初的核心 / uGUI 视图 / 模块系统"},"151":{"id":"/zh/history-33","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#三个转折点","content":"**反射 → 显式注册。** 0.1.0 通过 `[Terminal(\"name {0}\")]` 特性和反射绑定查找命令，\n1.0.0 又加上了 static 方法的自动扫描。为了让 IL2CPP/AOT 构建下的行为可预测，\n1.0.2 移除了特性、自动扫描和所有反射调用路径，只保留 `RegisterCommand(...)` 显式注册。"},"152":{"id":"/zh/history-34","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#三个转折点","content":"**接口拆分 → 具体核心。** 0.1.0 中的协作者接口（`ICommandRegistry`、`ICommandParser`、\n`IAutoCompleteProvider` 等）和 `TerminalBuilder` 在 1.0.0 中被删除，`Terminal` 直接持有\n具体协作者。扩展点只剩 `ICommand`、`ICommandOutput`、`ITerminalView`、`ITerminalModule` 四个。"},"153":{"id":"/zh/history-35","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#三个转折点","content":"**常驻 UI → 手势唤出 UI。** 0.1.0 中隐形的右上角双击区域在 1.0.0 变成可见的 `>_` 手柄\n（单击打开），而在 1.0.3 中该手柄本身也默认隐藏，只能通过多点触控手势唤出。"},"154":{"id":"/zh/history-36","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#103--手势与作弊-hud","content":"右上角 `>_` 手柄默认隐藏，**四指连点 3 次**可显示 / 隐藏。"},"155":{"id":"/zh/history-37","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#103--手势与作弊-hud","content":"新增从左侧滑入的 **UI Toolkit 作弊 HUD**。所有已注册命令会按分类自动列出，\n无参数的命令点按一次即可执行。**三指连点 3 次**开关面板。 → 作弊 HUD"},"156":{"id":"/zh/history-38","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#103--手势与作弊-hud","content":"手势由 `MultiFingerTapGesture` 负责，只有手指数量完全一致时才成立，\n因此三指与四指手势不会互相触发。"},"157":{"id":"/zh/history-39","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#103--手势与作弊-hud","content":"触摸输入通过 `TerminalInput` 抽象层，免反射地同时支持旧版 Input Manager 与 Input System 包\n（后者是通过版本定义解析的可选依赖）。"},"158":{"id":"/zh/history-40","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#103--手势与作弊-hud","content":"在仓库根目录新增了说明作弊命令编写规范的 `AGENT.md`。"},"159":{"id":"/zh/history-41","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#102--移除反射强化补全","content":"删除了 `TerminalAttribute`、`AttributeCommand` 以及基于反射的 Object Inspector 模块。\n原先通过特性注册的命令需要改为 `RegisterCommand(...)`。"},"160":{"id":"/zh/history-42","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#102--移除反射强化补全","content":"补全会缓存命令名、`usage` 关键字和命令自定义候选，并针对场景、日志、GameObject、\n组件目标、布尔值等提供上下文候选（引入 `ICommandCompletionProvider`、\n`CommandCompletionContext`、`CompletionItem`）。"},"161":{"id":"/zh/history-43","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#102--移除反射强化补全","content":"`RegisterDataTable(...)` 与 `data [table] [id|text]` 命令让游戏数据表免反射可查。"},"162":{"id":"/zh/history-44","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#102--移除反射强化补全","content":"终端 UI 新增 `Console / Commands / Data` 标签页。"},"163":{"id":"/zh/history-45","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#102--移除反射强化补全","content":"修复: 仅在显式 submit 时执行而非失焦时执行、输出前转义富文本敏感字符、\nUnity 组件命令使用不变文化解析、Logs 与 Performance 模块创建的辅助 GameObject 随\nbootstrap 一同销毁。"},"164":{"id":"/zh/history-46","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#102--移除反射强化补全","content":"同期将文档站点从 Docusaurus 迁移到 **Fumadocs + Next.js**，统一目录名为 `docs~`，\n确定 Introduction / Getting started / Usage / Changelog 结构，并新增韩语 `CHANGELOG.ko.md`。"},"165":{"id":"/zh/history-47","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#101--命名空间与-unity-组件命令","content":"命名空间由 `UniTerminal` 改为 `Achieve.CheatTerminal`（破坏性变更）。"},"166":{"id":"/zh/history-48","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#101--命名空间与-unity-组件命令","content":"新增直接操作 Unity 内置组件的命令: `transform`、`rb`、`cam`、`light`、`audio`、`time`、`go`。\n→ Unity 组件命令"},"167":{"id":"/zh/history-49","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#101--命名空间与-unity-组件命令","content":"文档本地化为 ko / en / ja / zh 四种语言，新增 `ITerminalModule` 进阶章节并引入 `CHANGELOG`。"},"168":{"id":"/zh/history-50","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#100--围绕具体核心重写","content":"移除协作者接口与 `TerminalBuilder`，`Terminal` 改为具体类。"},"169":{"id":"/zh/history-51","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#100--围绕具体核心重写","content":"`Terminal.ScanStaticCommands()` 自动注册 static `[Terminal]` 方法（该功能在 1.0.2 中被移除）。"},"170":{"id":"/zh/history-52","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#100--围绕具体核心重写","content":"**Runtime Logs 模块**: 将 `Debug.Log` 收集到环形缓冲区，通过\n`logs [n | error | warning | info | <text> | find <text> | clear | export]` 查询。\n`export` 会写入 `Application.persistentDataPath`，因此可以从真机取回日志。"},"171":{"id":"/zh/history-53","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#100--围绕具体核心重写","content":"输入框支持上下方向键回溯历史，并新增 `help <category>`。"},"172":{"id":"/zh/history-54","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#100--围绕具体核心重写","content":"修复 EventSystem 输入模块问题，把右上角触发区改为可见的 `>_` 手柄（单击打开），\n补齐 Unity `.meta` 文件，并确定包名 `com.achieve.cheat-terminal`。"},"173":{"id":"/zh/history-55","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#100--围绕具体核心重写","content":"接入文档站点（Docusaurus）与自动部署到 GitHub Pages 的 CI。"},"174":{"id":"/zh/history-56","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#010--首个版本","content":"由支持引号的解析器、历史记录、别名、参数转换、补全和输出缓冲组成的核心。"},"175":{"id":"/zh/history-57","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#010--首个版本","content":"基于 `[Terminal]` 特性的反射绑定，通过 `TerminalBuilder` 组装。"},"176":{"id":"/zh/history-58","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#010--首个版本","content":"关闭时完全停用的 uGUI 覆盖视图，以及右上角双击触发区。"},"177":{"id":"/zh/history-59","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#010--首个版本","content":"内置命令 `help` / `clear` / `history` / `echo` / `alias`。"},"178":{"id":"/zh/history-60","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#010--首个版本","content":"模块系统（`ITerminalModule`）与 Scene Tools / Object Inspector / Performance 模块，\n以及 Basic Usage 示例。"},"179":{"id":"/zh/history-61","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#升级速查","content":"过去"},"180":{"id":"/zh/history-62","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#升级速查","content":"现在"},"181":{"id":"/zh/history-63","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#升级速查","content":"`[Terminal]` 特性 / static 自动扫描"},"182":{"id":"/zh/history-64","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#升级速查","content":"`TerminalBehaviour.RegisterCommand(...)`"},"183":{"id":"/zh/history-65","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#升级速查","content":"`UniTerminal` 命名空间"},"184":{"id":"/zh/history-66","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#升级速查","content":"`Achieve.CheatTerminal`"},"185":{"id":"/zh/history-67","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#升级速查","content":"用 `TerminalBuilder` 组装"},"186":{"id":"/zh/history-68","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#升级速查","content":"`new Terminal()` + `AttachView(...)`"},"187":{"id":"/zh/history-69","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#升级速查","content":"Object Inspector 模块"},"188":{"id":"/zh/history-70","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#升级速查","content":"`RegisterDataTable(...)` 与 `data` 命令"},"189":{"id":"/zh/history-71","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#升级速查","content":"常驻显示的右上角手柄"},"190":{"id":"/zh/history-72","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#升级速查","content":"四指连点 3 次（`TerminalBehaviour.HandleVisible`）"},"191":{"id":"/zh/history-73","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#升级速查","content":"`TerminalCornerTrigger.Enabled`"},"192":{"id":"/zh/history-74","page_id":"/zh/history","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/history#升级速查","content":"`TerminalCornerTrigger.Visible`（`Enabled` 保留为别名）"},"193":{"id":"/zh","page_id":"/zh","type":"page","content":"介绍","breadcrumbs":["Docs"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh"},"194":{"id":"/zh-0","page_id":"/zh","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh#特性","content":"特性"},"195":{"id":"/zh-1","page_id":"/zh","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh#要求","content":"要求"},"196":{"id":"/zh-2","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh","content":"Cheat Terminal 是 Unity 运行时开发者控制台，用于作弊命令、调试、日志查看和运行时状态控制。"},"197":{"id":"/zh-3","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh","content":"命令通过 `RegisterCommand(...)` 显式注册。默认运行路径不进行自动程序集扫描，也不使用 reflection 调用，因此在 IL2CPP/AOT 构建中更可预测。控制台关闭时以 uGUI 覆盖层运行，**空闲成本为 0**。"},"198":{"id":"/zh-4","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#特性","content":"**显式注册** - 使用 `RegisterCommand(\"name\", ctx => ...)` 注册命令；没有隐藏的 reflection 扫描。"},"199":{"id":"/zh-5","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#特性","content":"**Runtime IntelliSense** - 显示 command、keyword、data table、row suggestions 及说明。"},"200":{"id":"/zh-6","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#特性","content":"**性能优先** - 关闭时禁用 Canvas，输出使用 capped ring buffer，历史导航使用通用的 `TerminalInput`。"},"201":{"id":"/zh-7","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#特性","content":"**模块化** - 默认安装 Scene / Data / Performance / Logs / Unity Components 模块。"},"202":{"id":"/zh-8","page_id":"/zh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh#特性","content":"**Tab UI** - Console / Commands / Data tab 显示输出、已注册命令和已注册数据。"},"203":{"id":"/zh-9","