dding-commands-7","page_id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/adding-commands","content":"命令通过 `RegisterCommand(...)` 显式注册。没有自动扫描，执行路径也不是 reflection 调用，而是固定的 `CommandContext` delegate。"},"217":{"id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands-8","page_id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/adding-commands","content":"> **usage 字符串规则** — `usage` 决定该作弊命令在作弊 HUD 中的执行方式。\n> 无参数时不要写括号（`god`），必填参数用 `<amount>`，可选参数用 `[amount]`。\n> HUD 会生成各参数的输入框和 Run 按钮，无需输入命令名称。 → 作弊 HUD"},"218":{"id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands-9","page_id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/adding-commands#基本注册","content":"在控制台运行 `gold 100000` 或 `god`。`help Cheats` 会显示该分类下的命令和说明。"},"219":{"id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands-10","page_id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/adding-commands#static-命令","content":"static 方法也不会自动收集。请在需要时显式注册。"},"220":{"id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands-11","page_id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/adding-commands#static-命令","content":"注册:"},"221":{"id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands-12","page_id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/adding-commands#参数","content":"从 `CommandContext` 读取参数。"},"222":{"id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands-13","page_id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/adding-commands#参数","content":"`ctx.Args`: 原始参数列表"},"223":{"id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands-14","page_id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/adding-commands#参数","content":"`ctx.Has(index)`: 参数是否存在"},"224":{"id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands-15","page_id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/adding-commands#参数","content":"`ctx.GetString/GetInt/GetFloat/GetBool`: 带 fallback 的简易 getter"},"225":{"id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands-16","page_id":"/zh/usage/adding-commands","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/adding-commands#参数","content":"需