sage/cheat-hud#布局","content":"底部状态栏带有一个大号 `CLOSE` 按钮，适合在长屏手机上够不到顶部 `X` 的情况。"},"261":{"id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud-25","page_id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud#布局","content":"如果仍然需要以前那种从左侧滑出的窄面板，关闭全屏即可。"},"262":{"id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud-26","page_id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud#打开--关闭监听","content":"打开 HUD 或控制台时游戏仍在运行。订阅开关状态即可降低 `Time.timeScale`、屏蔽输入等。"},"263":{"id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud-27","page_id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud#打开--关闭监听","content":"只想暂停时间的话一行就够。打开时的 `Time.timeScale` 会被保存，关闭时原样恢复。"},"264":{"id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud-28","page_id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud#打开--关闭监听","content":"用 `-=` 取消订阅。也可以直接从视图接收：`CheatHudView.OnOpened` / `OnClosed` /\n`OnVisibilityChanged`，以及 `UGuiTerminalView` 上的同名事件。"},"265":{"id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud-29","page_id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud#显示规则","content":"命令按 `category` 分组显示，内置的 `System` 分类始终排在最后。"},"266":{"id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud-30","page_id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud#显示规则","content":"顶部搜索框可按名称 / 描述 / 分类过滤。"},"267":{"id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud-31","page_id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud#显示规则","content":"`usage` 字符串决定执行方式。"},"268":{"id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud-32","page_id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud#显示规则","content":"usage"},"269":{"id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud-33","page_id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud#显示规则","content":"HUD 行为"},"270":{"id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud-34","page_id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud#显示规则","content":"`god`（无参数）"},"271":{"id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud-35","page_id":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/usage/cheat-hud#显示规则","content":"点击 Run 执行"},"272":{"id":"/zh/u